            "title_tag": "h2",
            "title": "L-Class Dust Extraction",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>The Vacmaster WD L30 PCF has been independently certified for the safe extraction of light hazardous dusts with a workplace exposure limit (WEL) value of &gt;1 mg/m3; including soft woods, gypsum, plasterboard and Corian. L-class industrial wet and dry vacuum cleaners are built for workshops, trades and construction sites.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
