            "image_loading": "",
            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h1",
            "title": "Heavy-Duty Construction",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>With 30L tank, suction tubes and fittings all moulded from thick-skinned stainless steel. Reinforced 10m cable with toughened PVC and crush resistant 2.5m suction hose. The WD L30 PCF is build to last.</p>",
